    "title": "Turf War - Skeleton Warzone",
    "description": "This is a single-player strategy game centered around resource collection and soldier production, where players take on the role of a lord and gradually strengthen their army by collecting resources. The key to the game lies in how to utilize limited resources, produce suitable units at the right time, and deploy your soldiers strategically to counter the enemy's attacks and challenges. Players need to employ tactics to make the best combat decisions in different battle situations.",
